{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_2000_place", "source_sha256": "f3aaed733e8359e2c088f4845dc6e2e071802d7b4fcabd4288bf14fddbace9cf", "ja": "ゲームフェス", "zh": "电玩展", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_2001_017kth", "source_sha256": "b5aaa9b4bd3ba106cd1d26a3aa6a03365604baff6e2fde172ec71ad40637f705", "ja": "今日はゲームフェスのお仕事ですね。\nゲームのことは、あまり詳しくありませんが……。", "zh": "今天是电玩展的工作。\n我对游戏并不是太了解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_2002_017kth", "source_sha256": "71a988c6c3eb061b059e29394947da8cee5188bc48b540b7b4da40818217b0be", "ja": "今日のイベントについては、私なりに調べてきました。\n参加している企業や目玉の新作、それに……。", "zh": "所以我自己对今天的活动进行了调查。\n像是参加的企业、受瞩目的新作，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_2003_p", "source_sha256": "94208e08dfb41edda76613f8cd68c8905c9f1e94f01836a3ace450be86d2a60f", "ja": "さすがだな、琴葉。とはいえ、まだ始まるまで\n時間があるし……先に、ゲームを遊んできたらどうだ？", "zh": "真不愧是琴叶。虽然这么说，\n离开始前还有点时间……先去玩玩看游戏如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_2004_017kth", "source_sha256": "d482fa2af03da24e28c58a6c8019d12d311deb9755f126280f195b01328dc28e", "ja": "えっ？　それは……いいんですか？\n今日は、お仕事で来ているのに……。", "zh": "咦？这样……可以吗？\n今天明明是来工作的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_2005_p", "source_sha256": "f114cee13b3a0617689b1c2cbd72c91b5bd320e65a9578bdff26e84970ae9975", "ja": "少しくらいならいいさ。お客さんに楽しんでもらう\nためにも、自分で、その魅力を知っておかないとな！", "zh": "只是一下子没有关系，而且为了让客人觉得开心，\n自己也要先了解游戏的魅力才行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_2006_017kth", "source_sha256": "439221465358a74660fa00eab7b0639dde75dd9e095e1b71833aafd3827b43d2", "ja": "{$P$}……ふふっ。\nそうですね、そうかもしれません。", "zh": "{$P$}……呵呵。\n说得也是，或许就是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_2007_017kth", "source_sha256": "317c9b8e85c85980a351e4f7fe8908575745f4464c3f854e1af5319c37123f20", "ja": "それじゃあ、ちょっとだけ……覗いてこようかな。\nありがとうございます、行ってきます！", "zh": "那么，我就稍微……看一下吧。\n谢谢你，我先去看看了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
